# Allowlist: only what the image needs. Everything else (.env, config.yaml,
# cookie jars, keys, tests, deployment files) never enters the build context.
*
!app/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
# Local files that could sit inside app/ during development.
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/config.yaml
**/*.log
